name: Link Analysis mobile money
tagline: "A seeded Link Analysis demo for mobile money - 420 wallets, 40 agents, 14 landed days with seven planted stories, staged next-day files, four Demo Users and an index that builds itself"
description: "Vertical A of the multi-vertical Link Analysis showcase (docs/archived-documents/plans-archive/la-multi-vertical-showcase-plan.md) as a Space Template: a Basic tier with an Advanced tier on top. Planted stories: agent-assisted structuring (25 wallets under the Tier-1 limit through AG-18), a 98 percent pass-through mule chain to cash-out agent AG-39, a nine-wallet device farm, the only directed cycle (four wallets, same amount), a dormant wallet awakening, the benign electricity biller hub MER-ELECTRIC, and a structuring Alert to Case. BASIC TIER (every edition, Basic included): three daily or snapshot Collectors + Pipelines + Datasets (wallet_txn, wallet_master, agent_master), the mm_links Job folding them into ONE link Dataset (kinds p2p, cash_in, cash_out, merchant_pay, shared_device, shared_id), the mm_kyc reference Dataset, three saved views, la_index_build and link-analysis.toon (the link index ON); masking_mode is left to the edition, so a Basic build, where nobody signs in, shows every id. Staged files in data/staged/wallet_txn are copied into data/inbox/wallet_txn by hand. ADVANCED TIER (a sign-in build; inert on Basic): typed masking with the admin's audited Reveal (mm_kyc's personal columns masked), the low four-eyes fan-out threshold of 100 and Drafts limits (link-analysis.toon), la_detect (every 5 minutes; with no Alert Rule bound it evaluates nothing), Demo Users and roles renamed for the vertical (roles.toon, demo-users.toon: admin, mm.analyst lead, mm.manager second approver, mm.reviewer read-only, mm.outsider not a member), and the runtime state the seed script writes (`node tools/seed-la-mm.mjs --apply`: Investigations, members, Entity Lists, a Case and a bound Alert Rule); the runbook docs/okf/product/solution-pack/la-mobile-money/admin-guide-showcase-runbook.md needs an Advanced or Preview build with Demo Auth (serve-demo). Regenerate the corpus with tools/gen-la-mm-data.py. Synthetic data only."
minEdition: basic
icon: heroicons_outline:share
contents[8]: "3 Pipelines + schemas (wallet_txn daily, wallet_master, agent_master) with 14 landed days", "Datasets incl. the mm_kyc reference (masked on sign-in builds)", "mm_links Job + Dataset", "3 saved views", "link-analysis.toon (index ON; typed masking, four-eyes and Drafts on sign-in builds)", "la_index_build Job; la_detect Job (Advanced tier, evaluates nothing on Basic)", "4 Demo Users + role table (Advanced tier, inert on Basic)", "Staged next-day and gap-day files"
